</section>

<section class="section" id="book">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="book">
      <a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/making-international-institutions-work/2B354270D50B9471D04529CD8D5C98F7" class="book__coverlink"><img class="book__cover" src="{{ '/assets/img/book-cover.jpg' | url }}"
           alt="Making International Institutions Work: The Politics of Performance, by Ranjit Lall (Cambridge University Press)"
           width="560" height="823"></a>
      <div>
        <span class="book__meta">Book &middot; Cambridge University Press &middot; 2023</span>
        <h2>Making International Institutions Work</h2>
        <blockquote>Challenging popular characterisations of international institutions as
          &lsquo;runaway bureaucracies&rsquo;, the most serious threat to performance comes from
          the pursuit of narrow political interests by states.</blockquote>
        <p>International institutions are essential for tackling many of the most urgent
          challenges facing the world, yet we know little about when they succeed, when they
          fail, and why. The book proposes a new theory of institutional performance and tests
          it using the most comprehensive dataset on the topic.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/book/' | url }}">About the book &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/making-international-institutions-work/2B354270D50B9471D04529CD8D5C98F7">Cambridge University Press &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pub__links" style="margin-top:.9rem">
          {% for b in publications.books %}<a href="{{ b.pdf | url }}">PDF</a>{% if b.doi %}<a href="https://doi.org/{{ b.doi }}">DOI</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

