<section class="section" id="data">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Data &amp; software</span>
      <h2>Open datasets and packages</h2>
      <p>Datasets and open-source tools from my research, hosted on GitHub, CRAN, PyPI, and Dataverse.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__kind">Dataset</span>
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/wingo">WINGO</a></h3>
        <p>The World of International Non-Governmental Organizations: more than 2,600 INGOs,
          with original data on founding and dissolution dates, headquarters, and issue areas.</p>
        <p class="card__use">Used in <a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/ajps.12824">&ldquo;Making Global Governance Accountable&rdquo;</a>, <em>AJPS</em> 2025</p>
        <div class="card__foot"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--outline" href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/wingo">GitHub &rarr;</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__kind">Dataset</span>
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/agg">AGG</a></h3>
        <p>Accountability in Global Governance: formal accountability mechanisms in 52 major
          international institutions, 1960&ndash;2018, across five categories.</p>
        <p class="card__use">Used in <a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/ajps.12824">&ldquo;Making Global Governance Accountable&rdquo;</a>, <em>AJPS</em> 2025</p>
        <div class="card__foot"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--outline" href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/agg">GitHub &rarr;</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__kind">Dataset</span>
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/piip">PIIP</a></h3>
        <p>Performance of International Institutions Project: assessments of 54 institutions,
          2008&ndash;2018, from six governments and the MOPAN network.</p>
        <p class="card__use">Used in <a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/making-international-institutions-work/2B354270D50B9471D04529CD8D5C98F7"><em>Making International Institutions Work</em></a>, CUP 2023</p>
        <div class="card__foot"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--outline" href="https://github.com/ranjitlall/piip">GitHub &rarr;</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__kind">Software</span>
        <div class="card__head">
          <img class="card__logo" src="{{ '/assets/img/midasverse.png' | url }}" alt="" width="150" height="150">
          <h3><a href="https://github.com/MIDASverse">MIDASverse</a></h3>
        </div>
        <p>Python and R packages for missing-data analysis using machine learning &mdash;
          MIDASpy, rMIDAS, citest, citestR. Developed with Thomas Robinson.</p>
        <p class="card__use">Introduced in <a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/political-analysis/article/abs/midas-touch-accurate-and-scalable-missingdata-imputation-with-deep-learning/5007854F57E88AF16D69BCCA4C5AF1FF">&ldquo;The MIDAS Touch&rdquo;</a>, <em>PA</em> 2022 &amp;
          <a href="https://www.jstatsoft.org/article/view/v107i09">&ldquo;Efficient Multiple Imputation&rdquo;</a>, <em>JSS</em> 2023</p>
        <div class="card__foot"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--outline" href="https://github.com/MIDASverse">GitHub &rarr;</a></div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ '/data_software/' | url }}">All data &amp; software &rarr;</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

